---
**Requirement 5: Conversation Management**
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- ✓ Conversation history persists across page navigation within the same browser session
- ✓ Conversation history persists between widget and full-page views within the same session
- ✓ An explicit "Clear conversation" button is available in both the widget and full-page view
- ✓ Clicking "Clear conversation" immediately resets the conversation to a clean state
- ✓ Closing the browser clears the conversation — no history persists on next visit
**Evaluation Criteria (Deterministic):**
- ✓ ACCEPT: User navigates between pages → conversation history intact
- ✓ ACCEPT: User clicks "Clear conversation" → conversation resets to empty state, confirmation prompt shown before clearing
- ✓ ACCEPT: User closes browser, reopens portal → conversation starts fresh with no previous history
- ✓ REJECT: Conversation state persists after browser close → fail (sessionStorage or equivalent, not localStorage)
- ✓ TIMING: Clear action completes < 300ms
**Clinical Safety:** N/A
**Information Governance:** Conversation data held in sessionStorage only — not persisted server-side; no GDPR retention obligation
**Security:** No conversation data written to server; sessionStorage scoped to tab/window
**Observability:** Clear conversation event rate, session duration, conversation length (message count)
**Frontend:** Clear button, confirmation prompt — @emisgroup/ui-* components, i18n, jest-axe
**Priority:** Must Have | **Effort:** Low | **Risk:** Low
**Depends On:** REQ-001, REQ-003
Is this correct?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31 19:36:33.124908+00');
