INSERT INTO message (message_id, conversation_id, role, content, token_count, user_ern, given_name, family_name, created_at) VALUES ('9bfdbbf1-3803-41a2-a6f3-5e48559a31f7', 'c91b73d1-cbc4-42f7-979a-57288d51a9aa', 'assistant', 'Great — so two loading states: a spinner for general processing, and contextual status messages when the bot is executing tool calls (e.g. "Searching documentation…", "Retrieving examples…").
✅ Cross-cutting requirements gate cleared. 1 gap found and addressed — adding as REQ-006.
Let me confirm Requirement 6:
---
**Requirement 6: Bot Loading & Status States**
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- ✓ While the bot is processing a response, a loading spinner is displayed in the chat interface
- ✓ When the bot is executing tool calls (e.g. searching documentation, retrieving examples), a contextual status message is shown to the user (e.g. "Searching documentation…", "Retrieving examples…")
- ✓ Status messages update in real-time as the bot progresses through tool calls
- ✓ Spinner and status messages disappear when the response is ready
- ✓ If the bot times out (>10s), a polite error message is shown: *"Sorry, that''s taking longer than expected. Please try again or escalate to our team."*
**Evaluation Criteria (Deterministic):**
- ✓ ACCEPT: Bot processing → spinner visible within 300ms of question submission
- ✓ ACCEPT: Tool call executing → contextual status message visible
- ✓ ACCEPT: Response received → spinner and status messages removed, response displayed
- ✓ ACCEPT: Timeout >10s → polite timeout error message shown with escalation prompt
- ✓ TIMING: Spinner appears < 300ms after question submission
**Clinical Safety:** N/A
**Information Governance:** No data captured in loading states
**Security:** Status messages must not expose internal system details or tool call internals
**Observability:** Tool call duration per type, timeout rate, spinner-to-response duration
**Frontend:** Spinner component, status message live region (aria-live="polite") — @emisgroup/ui-* components, i18n, jest-axe
**Priority:** Must Have | **Effort:** Low | **Risk:** Low
**Depends On:** REQ-001
Is this correct?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-31 19:42:35.505094+00');
