      <button class="sl-sidebar-item sub" onclick="navigateTo(''fhir-api'')">FHIR R4 API</button>
      <button class="sl-sidebar-item sub" onclick="navigateTo(''rest-api'')">REST API Reference</button>
      <button class="sl-sidebar-item sub" onclick="navigateTo(''webhooks'')">Webhooks</button>
    </div>
    <div class="sl-sidebar-section">
      <div class="sl-sidebar-section-title">Interoperability</div>
      <button class="sl-sidebar-item sub" onclick="navigateTo(''hl7-messaging'')">HL7 Messaging</button>
      <button class="sl-sidebar-item sub" onclick="navigateTo(''data-mapping'')">Data Mapping</button>
    </div>
  </nav>
  <!-- MAIN CONTENT AREA -->
  <main class="sl-content" id="main-content">
    <!-- ── PAGE: HOME ── -->
    <div id="page-home" class="content-inner">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <span>Docs</span> / <span>Overview</span>
      </div>
      <h1>EMIS Developer Portal</h1>
      <p class="page-description">
        Everything you need to integrate with EMIS APIs, SMART-on-FHIR app launch, and interoperability standards.
      </p>
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>
      <p>Welcome to the EMIS Developer Portal. This documentation covers authentication flows, FHIR R4 API integration, HL7 messaging, and SMART App Launch.</p>
      <div class="aside">
        💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Use the <strong>Ask the Bot</strong> widget (bottom-right) to get instant answers to your integration questions.
      </div>
      <h2>Popular Topics</h2>
      <p>Click any topic in the sidebar, or ask the bot directly. Common questions include OAuth2 flow selection, token refresh patterns, and FHIR resource mapping.</p>
      <h3>Authentication</h3>
      <p>EMIS APIs use OAuth2. For backend services, use the <code>client_credentials</code> flow. For user-facing apps, use the SMART App Launch protocol with <code>authorization_code</code> flow.</p>
      <pre><code>// Backend API authentication
POST /oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
grant_type=client_credentials
&amp;client_id=your_client_id
&amp;client_secret=your_client_secret
&amp;scope=system/*.read</code></pre>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: QUICKSTART ── -->
    <div id="page-quickstart" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Getting Started</span> / <span>Quick Start</span></div>
      <h1>Quick Start</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Get up and running with EMIS APIs in under 10 minutes.</p>
      <h2>Step 1: Register your application</h2>
      <p>Register your application in the EMIS Developer Console to receive your <code>client_id</code> and <code>client_secret</code>.</p>
      <h2>Step 2: Choose your auth flow</h2>
      <p>Backend APIs → <code>client_credentials</code>. User-facing apps → SMART App Launch.</p>
      <h2>Step 3: Make your first API call</h2>
      <pre><code>GET /fhir/r4/Patient/example-id
Authorization: Bearer {access_token}
Accept: application/fhir+json</code></pre>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: AUTH OVERVIEW ── -->
    <div id="page-auth-overview" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Authentication</span> / <span>Overview</span></div>
      <h1>Authentication Overview</h1>
      <p class="page-description">EMIS APIs use OAuth2 and SMART-on-FHIR for secure access.</p>
      <h2>Supported Flows</h2>
      <p>EMIS supports three authentication flows depending on your use case:</p>
      <h3>1. Client Credentials (Backend Services)</h3>
      <p>Use this when your application runs server-side without a user context. Suitable for data pipelines, scheduled jobs, and backend integrations.</p>
      <h3>2. Authorization Code (User-Facing Apps)</h3>
      <p>Use this for applications where a user must authenticate. Combines with SMART App Launch for clinical context.</p>
      <h3>3. SMART App Launch</h3>
      <p>EMIS''s implementation of the SMART-on-FHIR specification. Provides clinical context (patient, encounter) alongside the OAuth2 token.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: OAUTH2 FLOWS ── -->
    <div id="page-oauth2-flows" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Authentication</span> / <span>OAuth2 Flows</span></div>
      <h1>OAuth2 Flows</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Detailed guide to EMIS OAuth2 implementation.</p>
      <h2>Client Credentials Flow</h2>
      <p>For backend services that do not act on behalf of a specific user.</p>
      <pre><code>POST https://auth.emis.com/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
grant_type=client_credentials
&amp;client_id=CLIENT_ID
&amp;client_secret=CLIENT_SECRET
&amp;scope=system/Patient.read system/Observation.read</code></pre>
      <h2>Authorization Code Flow</h2>
      <p>For user-facing applications. Redirect the user to the EMIS authorisation endpoint, then exchange the code for a token.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: SMART LAUNCH ── -->
    <div id="page-smart-launch" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Authentication</span> / <span>SMART App Launch</span></div>
      <h1>SMART App Launch</h1>
      <p class="page-description">EMIS implementation of the SMART-on-FHIR App Launch Framework.</p>
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>SMART App Launch allows your application to receive clinical context (patient ID, encounter ID) alongside the OAuth2 access token.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: TOKEN REFRESH ── -->
    <div id="page-token-refresh" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Authentication</span> / <span>Token Refresh</span></div>
      <h1>Token Refresh</h1>
      <p class="page-description">How to refresh access tokens without re-authenticating the user.</p>
      <h2>Refresh Token Flow</h2>
      <p>Exchange a refresh token for a new access token using the <code>refresh_token</code> grant type.</p>
      <pre><code>POST /oauth2/token
grant_type=refresh_token
&amp;refresh_token=REFRESH_TOKEN
&amp;client_id=CLIENT_ID</code></pre>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: FHIR API ── -->
    <div id="page-fhir-api" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>APIs</span> / <span>FHIR R4 API</span></div>
      <h1>FHIR R4 API</h1>
      <p class="page-description">EMIS FHIR R4 compliant API reference.</p>
      <h2>Base URL</h2>
      <pre><code>https://api.emis.com/fhir/r4</code></pre>
      <h2>Supported Resources</h2>
      <p>Patient, Observation, Condition, MedicationRequest, Appointment, and more.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: REST API ── -->
    <div id="page-rest-api" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>APIs</span> / <span>REST API Reference</span></div>
      <h1>REST API Reference</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Full REST API endpoint reference for EMIS integrations.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: WEBHOOKS ── -->
    <div id="page-webhooks" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>APIs</span> / <span>Webhooks</span></div>
      <h1>Webhooks</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Receive real-time notifications from EMIS systems.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: HL7 ── -->
    <div id="page-hl7-messaging" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Interoperability</span> / <span>HL7 Messaging</span></div>
      <h1>HL7 Messaging</h1>
      <p class="page-description">EMIS HL7 v2 and FHIR messaging patterns.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── PAGE: DATA MAPPING ── -->
    <div id="page-data-mapping" class="content-inner hidden">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><span>Docs</span> / <span>Interoperability</span> / <span>Data Mapping</span></div>
      <h1>Data Mapping</h1>
      <p class="page-description">Map EMIS data models to standard interoperability formats.</p>
    </div>
    <!-- ── UNAUTHENTICATED VIEW ── -->
    <div id="page-unauth" class="hidden">
      <div class="unauth-content">
        <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
        <h2>Authentication required</h2>
        <p>You must sign in with your EMIS-X credentials to access the EMIS Developer Portal and the Q&A assistant.</p>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="simulateLogin()">Sign in with EMIS-X</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================
     CHAT WIDGET
     ============================================================ -->
<div id="chat-widget">
  <!-- FAB button -->
  <button class="widget-fab" id="widget-fab" onclick="toggleWidget()" aria-label="Open EMIS Interop Assistant" aria-expanded="false">
    💬
    <span class="unread-badge hidden" id="unread-badge" aria-label="1 new message">1</span>
  </button>
  <!-- Widget panel -->
  <div class="widget-panel hidden" id="widget-panel" role="dialog" aria-label="EMIS Interop Assistant" aria-modal="false">
    <!-- Widget header -->
    <div class="widget-header">
      <div class="bot-avatar">🤖</div>
      <div class="bot-info">
        <div class="bot-name">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>
        <div class="bot-status">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Online · Docs indexed
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="widget-header-actions">
        <button class="widget-icon-btn" onclick="expandToFullPage()" aria-label="Expand to full-page chat" title="Expand">⤢</button>
        <button class="widget-icon-btn" onclick="openClearDialog(''widget'')" aria-label="Clear conversation" title="Clear conversation">🗑</button>
        <button class="widget-icon-btn" onclick="toggleWidget()" aria-label="Close assistant" title="Close">✕</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Messages -->
    <div class="widget-messages" id="widget-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation history">
      <!-- Populated by JS -->
    </div>
    <!-- Input area -->
    <div class="widget-input-area">
      <div class="widget-input-row">
        <textarea
          class="widget-input"
          id="widget-input"
          placeholder="Ask about EMIS interoperability…"
          aria-label="Ask a question about EMIS interoperability"
          rows="1"
          onkeydown="handleWidgetKey(event)"
        ></textarea>
        <button class="widget-send-btn" id="widget-send-btn" onclick="sendWidgetMessage()" aria-label="Send message">↑</button>
      </div>
      <div class="widget-input-footer" id="widget-footer-text">
        50 messages remaining this session
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================
     CLEAR CONVERSATION DIALOG
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="modal-backdrop" id="clear-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="clear-dialog-title">
  <div class="modal">
    <h3 id="clear-dialog-title">Clear conversation?</h3>
    <p>This will permanently delete your current conversation history. This action cannot be undone.</p>
    <div class="modal-actions">
      <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="closeClearDialog()">Cancel</button>
      <button class="btn-danger" onclick="confirmClear()">Clear conversation</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================
     DEMO TOOLBAR
     ============================================================ -->
<div class="demo-toolbar" role="complementary" aria-label="Prototype demo controls">
  <span class="toolbar-label">Demo</span>
  <button class="demo-btn active" id="btn-auth" onclick="setAuthState(true)">✓ Authenticated</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" id="btn-unauth" onclick="setAuthState(false)">🔒 Unauthenticated</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="loadScenario(''in-scope'')" title="Scenario A: in-scope question with citation">💬 In-scope answer</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="loadScenario(''deflection'')" title="Scenario B: out-of-scope deflection">🚫 Deflection</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="loadScenario(''escalation'')" title="Scenario C: escalation flow">📧 Escalation</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="loadScenario(''timeout'')" title="Scenario D: timeout error">⏱ Timeout</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="loadScenario(''loading'')" title="Show loading states">⏳ Loading states</button>
  <button class="demo-btn" onclick="resetAll()">↺ Reset all</button>
</div>
<!-- ============================================================
     JAVASCRIPT
     ============================================================ -->
<script>
/* ============================================================
   STATE
   ============================================================ */
var state = {
  isAuthenticated: true,
  widgetOpen: false,
  currentPage: ''home'',
  clearTarget: null,  // ''widget'' or ''fullpage''
  isFullPage: false,
  messages: [],       // shared conversation array
  messageCount: 0,
  rateLimit: 50,
  isLoading: false,
  loadingStep: 0,
  loadingTimer: null
};
/* ============================================================
   FICTIONAL DATA
   ============================================================ */
var SCENARIOS = {
  ''in-scope'': {
    userMsg: ''Which auth flow should I use for a backend API that calls EMIS APIs without a user context?'',
    botResponse: {
      type: ''answer'',
      text: ''For a backend API that calls EMIS APIs without a user context, you should use the <strong>Client Credentials</strong> OAuth2 flow. This flow is designed exactly for server-to-server communication where there is no end user involved.\\n\\nYou\\''ll POST to the token endpoint with your <code>client_id</code>, <code>client_secret</code>, and the desired <code>scope</code> (e.g. <code>system/*.read</code>). The response gives you a bearer token valid for a configurable period — typically 1 hour.'',
      citation: {
        url: ''https://developer.emis.com/docs/authentication/oauth2-flows'',
        quote: ''Use the client_credentials grant type for backend services that do not act on behalf of a specific user. This flow requires your client_id and client_secret and returns a system-scoped access token.''
      }
    }
  },
  ''deflection'': {
    userMsg: "What''s the weather like today?",
    botResponse: {
      type: ''deflection'',
      text: "I can only help with questions about EMIS interoperability — please try asking about our APIs or authentication flows. For example, you could ask about OAuth2 flows, SMART App Launch, FHIR R4 resources, or HL7 messaging."
    }
  },
  ''escalation'': {
    userMsg: ''How do I handle token refresh for SMART on FHIR when the user\\''s session expires mid-consultation?'',
    botResponse: {
      type: ''escalation'',
      text: "I wasn''t able to find a definitive answer for this specific scenario in the indexed documentation. This may be a more advanced edge case not yet covered in our docs."
    }
  },
  ''timeout'': {
    userMsg: ''Can you explain the full EMIS data model for clinical observations?'',
    botResponse: {
      type: ''timeout''
    }
  },
  ''loading'': {
    userMsg: ''What FHIR resources does EMIS support for patient demographics?'',
    botResponse: {
      type: ''answer'',
      text: ''EMIS supports the following FHIR R4 resources for patient demographics: <strong>Patient</strong> (core demographics including name, DOB, address, identifiers), <strong>RelatedPerson</strong> (next of kin and carers), and <strong>Organization</strong> (GP practice and registered organisation).\\n\\nThe <code>Patient</code> resource is the primary resource and maps directly to the EMIS patient record.'',
      citation: {
        url: ''https://developer.emis.com/docs/fhir/r4/patient-demographics'',
        quote: ''The EMIS FHIR R4 Patient resource conforms to the UK Core Patient profile and includes NHS Number as a primary identifier alongside local patient identifiers.''
      }
    }
  }
};
var LOADING_STEPS = [
  { icon: ''🔍'', text: ''Searching documentation…'' },
  { icon: ''📄'', text: ''Retrieving relevant sections…'' },
  { icon: ''🔗'', text: ''Checking citations…'' },
  { icon: ''✍️'', text: ''Composing answer…'' }
];
/* ============================================================
   INIT
   ============================================================ */
document.addEventListener(''DOMContentLoaded'', function() {
  renderWidgetMessages();
  showWelcomeMessage();
  updateNavHighlight(''home'');
});
/* ============================================================
   AUTH STATE
   ============================================================ */
function setAuthState(isAuth) {
  state.isAuthenticated = isAuth;
  var widget = document.getElementById(''chat-widget'');
  var unauth = document.getElementById(''page-unauth'');
  var mainContent = document.getElementById(''main-content'');
  var authBtn = document.getElementById(''btn-auth'');
  var unauthBtn = document.getElementById(''btn-unauth'');
  if (isAuth) {
    widget.style.display = ''flex'';
    unauth.classList.add(''hidden'');
    showPage(state.currentPage);
    authBtn.classList.add(''active'');
    unauthBtn.classList.remove(''active'');
    document.getElementById(''header-auth'').style.display = ''flex'';
  } else {
    // Close widget first
    if (state.widgetOpen) toggleWidget();
    widget.style.display = ''none'';
    // Hide all pages
    var pages = mainContent.querySelectorAll(''.content-inner, #page-unauth'');
    pages.forEach(function(p) { p.classList.add(''hidden''); });
    unauth.classList.remove(''hidden'');
    authBtn.classList.remove(''active'');
    unauthBtn.classList.add(''active'');
    document.getElementById(''header-auth'').style.display = ''none'';
  }
}
function simulateLogin() {
  setAuthState(true);
}
/* ============================================================
   NAVIGATION
   ============================================================ */
function navigateTo(pageId) {
  if (!state.isAuthenticated) return;
  state.currentPage = pageId;
  showPage(pageId);
  updateNavHighlight(pageId);
  // Simulate session persistence — messages survive navigation
  // (they''re already in state.messages, no action needed)
}
function showPage(pageId) {
  var mainContent = document.getElementById(''main-content'');
  var pages = mainContent.querySelectorAll(''[id^="page-"]'');
  pages.forEach(function(p) { p.classList.add(''hidden''); });
  var target = document.getElementById(''page-'' + pageId);
  if (target) target.classList.remove(''hidden'');
}
function updateNavHighlight(pageId) {
  var items = document.querySelectorAll(''.sl-sidebar-item'');
  items.forEach(function(item) { item.classList.remove(''active''); });
  // Map page IDs to nav button onclick values
  var map = {
    ''home'': 0, ''quickstart'': 1, ''auth-overview'': 2,
    ''oauth2-flows'': 3, ''smart-launch'': 4, ''token-refresh'': 5,
    ''fhir-api'': 6, ''rest-api'': 7, ''webhooks'': 8,
    ''hl7-messaging'': 9, ''data-mapping'': 10
  };
  if (map[pageId] !== undefined && items[map[pageId]]) {
    items[map[pageId]].classList.add(''active'');
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   WIDGET TOGGLE
   ============================================================ */
function toggleWidget() {
  if (!state.isAuthenticated) return;
  state.widgetOpen = !state.widgetOpen;
  var panel = document.getElementById(''widget-panel'');
  var fab = document.getElementById(''widget-fab'');
  var badge = document.getElementById(''unread-badge'');
  if (state.widgetOpen) {
    panel.classList.remove(''hidden'');
    fab.setAttribute(''aria-expanded'', ''true'');
    fab.innerHTML = ''✕'';
    badge.classList.add(''hidden'');
    // Focus input
    setTimeout(function() {
      document.getElementById(''widget-input'').focus();
    }, 100);
    scrollWidgetToBottom();
  } else {
    panel.classList.add(''hidden'');
    fab.setAttribute(''aria-expanded'', ''false'');
    fab.innerHTML = ''💬'';
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   EXPAND / MINIMISE
   ============================================================ */
function expandToFullPage() {
  state.isFullPage = true;
  // Hide portal shell
  document.getElementById(''portal-shell'').style.display = ''none'';
  document.getElementById(''chat-widget'').style.display = ''none'';
  // Show fullpage
  var fp = document.getElementById(''view-fullpage'');
  fp.classList.add(''active'');
  // Render messages in fullpage
  renderFullpageMessages();
  // Focus input
  setTimeout(function() {
    document.getElementById(''fullpage-input'').focus();
  }, 100);
}
function minimiseToWidget() {
  state.isFullPage = false;
  // Hide fullpage
  var fp = document.getElementById(''view-fullpage'');
  fp.classList.remove(''active'');
  // Show portal
  document.getElementById(''portal-shell'').style.display = ''grid'';
  document.getElementById(''chat-widget'').style.display = ''flex'';
  // Ensure widget is open
  if (!state.widgetOpen) {
    state.widgetOpen = true;
    document.getElementById(''widget-panel'').classList.remove(''hidden'');
    document.getElementById(''widget-fab'').setAttribute(''aria-expanded'', ''true'');
    document.getElementById(''widget-fab'').innerHTML = ''✕'';
  }
  renderWidgetMessages();
  scrollWidgetToBottom();
}
/* ============================================================
   MESSAGE RENDERING
   ============================================================ */
function renderWidgetMessages() {
  var container = document.getElementById(''widget-messages'');
  if (!container) return;
  container.innerHTML = '''';
  if (state.messages.length === 0) {
    container.appendChild(createWelcomeEl());
    return;
  }
  state.messages.forEach(function(msg) {
    container.appendChild(createWidgetMsgEl(msg));
  });
}
function renderFullpageMessages() {
  var container = document.getElementById(''fullpage-messages'');
  if (!container) return;
  container.innerHTML = '''';
  if (state.messages.length === 0) {
    var welcome = document.createElement(''div'');
    welcome.style.cssText = ''text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:#6b7280;'';
    welcome.innerHTML = ''<div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;">🤖</div><h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1e1b2e;margin-bottom:8px;">EMIS Interop Assistant</h3><p style="font-size:14px;">Ask me anything about EMIS APIs, authentication flows, FHIR resources, or HL7 messaging.</p>'';
    container.appendChild(welcome);
    return;
  }
  state.messages.forEach(function(msg) {
    container.appendChild(createFullpageMsgEl(msg));
  });
  // Update sidebar counts
  document.getElementById(''fp-msg-count'').textContent = state.messages.length;
  document.getElementById(''fp-rate-limit'').textContent = state.rateLimit + '' remaining'';
}
function createWelcomeEl() {
  var el = document.createElement(''div'');
  el.className = ''welcome-msg'';
  el.innerHTML = ''<div class="welcome-icon">🤖</div>'' +
    ''<h4>EMIS Interop Assistant</h4>'' +
    ''<p>Ask me anything about EMIS APIs, authentication, FHIR, or HL7.</p>'' +
    ''<div class="welcome-suggestions">'' +
    ''<button class="suggestion-chip" onclick="fillAndSend(\\''Which auth flow should I use for a backend API?\\'')">Which auth flow for a backend API?</button>'' +
    ''<button class="suggestion-chip" onclick="fillAndSend(\\''How do I handle token refresh for SMART on FHIR?\\'')">How do I handle SMART token refresh?</button>'' +
    ''<button class="suggestion-chip" onclick="fillAndSend(\\''What FHIR resources does EMIS support?\\'')">What FHIR resources are supported?</button>'' +
    ''</div>'';
  return el;
}
function fillAndSend(text) {
  document.getElementById(''widget-input'').value = text;
  sendWidgetMessage();
}
function createWidgetMsgEl(msg) {
  var outer = document.createElement(''div'');
  if (msg.type === ''user'') {
    outer.className = ''msg user'';
    outer.innerHTML =
      ''<div class="msg-avatar">AP</div>'' +
      ''<div class="msg-bubble">'' + escHtml(msg.text) + ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''answer'') {
    outer.className = ''msg bot'';
    var bubbleHtml = ''<div class="msg-bubble">'' + msg.text;
    if (msg.citation) {
      bubbleHtml += ''<div class="citation-card">'' +
        ''<div class="citation-label">📎 Source</div>'' +
        ''<a class="citation-url" href="#" onclick="return false;">'' + escHtml(msg.citation.url) + ''</a>'' +
        ''<div class="citation-quote">"'' + escHtml(msg.citation.quote) + ''"</div>'' +
        ''</div>'';
    }
    bubbleHtml += ''</div>'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' + bubbleHtml;
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''deflection'') {
    outer.className = ''msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="deflection-bubble">⚠️ '' + escHtml(msg.text) + ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''escalation-prompt'') {
    outer.className = ''msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="msg-bubble">'' + escHtml(msg.text) +
      ''<div class="escalation-form" id="escalation-form-widget">'' +
        ''<div class="esc-title">📧 Escalate to our team</div>'' +
        ''<div class="esc-desc">Provide your email address and we\\''ll get back to you. We\\''ll also send the Teams team a notification with your question.</div>'' +
        ''<div class="form-field">'' +
          ''<label class="form-label" for="esc-email-widget">Email address</label>'' +
          ''<input type="email" class="form-input" id="esc-email-widget" placeholder="you@partnerco.io" aria-label="Your email address" aria-describedby="esc-email-error-widget">'' +
          ''<div class="form-error" id="esc-email-error-widget" role="alert">Please enter a valid email address</div>'' +
        ''</div>'' +
        ''<button class="esc-submit" id="esc-submit-widget" onclick="submitEscalation(\\''widget\\'')">Send escalation</button>'' +
      ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''escalation-success'') {
    outer.className = ''msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="escalation-success">'' +
        ''<span class="success-icon">✅</span>'' +
        ''<span>Thanks for reaching out — we\\''ve received your question and will be in touch soon. A confirmation email has been sent to <strong>'' + escHtml(msg.email || ''your address'') + ''</strong>.</span>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''error'') {
    outer.className = ''msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="error-bubble" role="alert">'' +
        ''⏱ Sorry, that\\''s taking longer than expected. Please try again or escalate to our team.'' +
        ''<div class="error-actions">'' +
          ''<button class="error-link" onclick="loadScenario(\\''escalation\\'')">Escalate to our team</button>'' +
          ''<span style="color:#d1d5db;font-size:12px;">·</span>'' +
          ''<button class="error-link" onclick="retryLastMessage()">Try again</button>'' +
        ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  return outer;
}
function createFullpageMsgEl(msg) {
  var outer = document.createElement(''div'');
  if (msg.type === ''user'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg user'';
    outer.innerHTML =
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">AP</div>'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content">'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">You</div>'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-bubble">'' + escHtml(msg.text) + ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''answer'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
    var inner = ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div><div class="fullpage-msg-content"><div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div><div class="fullpage-bubble">'' + msg.text;
    if (msg.citation) {
      inner += ''<div class="citation-card" style="margin-top:10px;">'' +
        ''<div class="citation-label">📎 Source</div>'' +
        ''<a class="citation-url" href="#" onclick="return false;">'' + escHtml(msg.citation.url) + ''</a>'' +
        ''<div class="citation-quote">"'' + escHtml(msg.citation.quote) + ''"</div>'' +
        ''</div>'';
    }
    inner += ''</div></div>'';
    outer.innerHTML = inner;
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''deflection'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content">'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>'' +
        ''<div class="deflection-bubble" style="border-radius:12px;border-top-left-radius:2px;">⚠️ '' + escHtml(msg.text) + ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''escalation-prompt'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content" style="max-width:520px;">'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-bubble">'' + escHtml(msg.text) +
          ''<div class="escalation-form" id="escalation-form-fullpage" style="margin-top:12px;">'' +
            ''<div class="esc-title">📧 Escalate to our team</div>'' +
            ''<div class="esc-desc">Provide your email address and we\\''ll get back to you.</div>'' +
            ''<div class="form-field">'' +
              ''<label class="form-label" for="esc-email-fullpage">Email address</label>'' +
              ''<input type="email" class="form-input" id="esc-email-fullpage" placeholder="you@partnerco.io" aria-label="Your email address" aria-describedby="esc-email-error-fullpage">'' +
              ''<div class="form-error" id="esc-email-error-fullpage" role="alert">Please enter a valid email address</div>'' +
            ''</div>'' +
            ''<button class="esc-submit" id="esc-submit-fullpage" onclick="submitEscalation(\\''fullpage\\'')">Send escalation</button>'' +
          ''</div>'' +
        ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''escalation-success'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content">'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>'' +
        ''<div class="escalation-success" style="border-radius:12px;">'' +
          ''<span class="success-icon">✅</span>'' +
          ''<span>Thanks for reaching out — we\\''ve received your question and will be in touch soon. A confirmation email has been sent to <strong>'' + escHtml(msg.email || ''your address'') + ''</strong>.</span>'' +
        ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  if (msg.type === ''error'') {
    outer.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
    outer.innerHTML = ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content">'' +
        ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>'' +
        ''<div class="error-bubble" role="alert" style="border-radius:12px;border-top-left-radius:2px;">'' +
          ''⏱ Sorry, that\\''s taking longer than expected. Please try again or escalate to our team.'' +
          ''<div class="error-actions">'' +
            ''<button class="error-link" onclick="loadScenario(\\''escalation\\'')">Escalate to our team</button>'' +
          ''</div>'' +
        ''</div>'' +
      ''</div>'';
    return outer;
  }
  return outer;
}
/* ============================================================
   SEND MESSAGE
   ============================================================ */
function sendWidgetMessage() {
  var input = document.getElementById(''widget-input'');
  var text = input.value.trim();
  if (!text || state.isLoading) return;
  if (state.rateLimit <= 0) {
    showRateLimitWarning();
    return;
  }
  input.value = '''';
  state.rateLimit--;
  state.messageCount++;
  // Add user message
  state.messages.push({ type: ''user'', text: text });
  renderWidgetMessages();
  scrollWidgetToBottom();
  // Show loading
  showWidgetLoading();
  // Determine response (simple keyword matching for demo)
  var scenario = detectScenario(text);
  var delay = scenario === ''timeout'' ? 1500 : 2000;
  setTimeout(function() {
    hideWidgetLoading();
    var response = SCENARIOS[scenario] ? SCENARIOS[scenario].botResponse : SCENARIOS[''in-scope''].botResponse;
    state.messages.push(response);
    renderWidgetMessages();
    scrollWidgetToBottom();
    updateRateLimitDisplay();
  }, delay);
}
function sendFullpageMessage() {
  var input = document.getElementById(''fullpage-input'');
  var text = input.value.trim();
  if (!text || state.isLoading) return;
  if (state.rateLimit <= 0) return;
  input.value = '''';
  state.rateLimit--;
  state.messageCount++;
  state.messages.push({ type: ''user'', text: text });
  renderFullpageMessages();
  scrollFullpageToBottom();
  // Show loading in fullpage
  showFullpageLoading();
  var scenario = detectScenario(text);
  var delay = scenario === ''timeout'' ? 1500 : 2000;
  setTimeout(function() {
    hideFullpageLoading();
    var response = SCENARIOS[scenario] ? SCENARIOS[scenario].botResponse : SCENARIOS[''in-scope''].botResponse;
    state.messages.push(response);
    renderFullpageMessages();
    scrollFullpageToBottom();
  }, delay);
}
function detectScenario(text) {
  var lower = text.toLowerCase();
  if (lower.includes(''weather'') || lower.includes(''stock'') || lower.includes(''recipe'') || lower.includes(''sport'')) return ''deflection'';
  if (lower.includes(''escalat'') || lower.includes(''token refresh'') || lower.includes(''smart on fhir'') || lower.includes(''mid-consult'')) return ''escalation'';
  if (lower.includes(''data model'') || lower.includes(''full'') && lower.includes(''clinical'')) return ''timeout'';
  return ''in-scope'';
}
function handleWidgetKey(e) {
  if (e.key === ''Enter'' && !e.shiftKey) {
    e.preventDefault();
    sendWidgetMessage();
  }
}
function handleFullpageKey(e) {
  if (e.key === ''Enter'' && !e.shiftKey) {
    e.preventDefault();
    sendFullpageMessage();
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   LOADING STATES
   ============================================================ */
var widgetLoadingEl = null;
var fullpageLoadingEl = null;
var loadingStepInterval = null;
function showWidgetLoading() {
  state.isLoading = true;
  document.getElementById(''widget-send-btn'').disabled = true;
  var container = document.getElementById(''widget-messages'');
  widgetLoadingEl = document.createElement(''div'');
  widgetLoadingEl.className = ''loading-state'';
  widgetLoadingEl.id = ''widget-loading-el'';
  widgetLoadingEl.setAttribute(''role'', ''status'');
  widgetLoadingEl.setAttribute(''aria-live'', ''polite'');
  widgetLoadingEl.innerHTML =
    ''<div class="msg-avatar" style="background:var(--sl-accent);color:white;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;flex-shrink:0;">🤖</div>'' +
    ''<div class="loading-bubble">'' +
      ''<div class="loading-dots"><div class="loading-dot"></div><div class="loading-dot"></div><div class="loading-dot"></div></div>'' +
      ''<div class="status-text" id="widget-status-text"><span class="status-spinner"></span> <span id="widget-status-label">Searching documentation…</span></div>'' +
    ''</div>'';
  container.appendChild(widgetLoadingEl);
  scrollWidgetToBottom();
  // Cycle through loading steps
  var step = 0;
  loadingStepInterval = setInterval(function() {
    step = (step + 1) % LOADING_STEPS.length;
    var label = document.getElementById(''widget-status-label'');
    if (label) label.textContent = LOADING_STEPS[step].text;
  }, 600);
}
function hideWidgetLoading() {
  state.isLoading = false;
  document.getElementById(''widget-send-btn'').disabled = false;
  if (loadingStepInterval) { clearInterval(loadingStepInterval); loadingStepInterval = null; }
  var el = document.getElementById(''widget-loading-el'');
  if (el) el.remove();
}
function showFullpageLoading() {
  state.isLoading = true;
  var container = document.getElementById(''fullpage-messages'');
  fullpageLoadingEl = document.createElement(''div'');
  fullpageLoadingEl.className = ''fullpage-msg bot'';
  fullpageLoadingEl.id = ''fullpage-loading-el'';
  fullpageLoadingEl.setAttribute(''role'', ''status'');
  fullpageLoadingEl.setAttribute(''aria-live'', ''polite'');
  fullpageLoadingEl.innerHTML =
    ''<div class="fullpage-msg-avatar">🤖</div>'' +
    ''<div class="fullpage-msg-content">'' +
      ''<div class="fullpage-msg-label">EMIS Interop Assistant</div>'' +
      ''<div class="loading-bubble" style="border-radius:12px;border-top-left-radius:2px;">'' +
        ''<div class="loading-dots"><div class="loading-dot"></div><div class="loading-dot"></div><div class="loading-dot"></div></div>'' +
        ''<div class="status-text"><span class="status-spinner"></span> <span id="fp-status-label">Searching documentation…</span></div>'' +
      ''</div>'' +
    ''</div>'';
  container.appendChild(fullpageLoadingEl);
  scrollFullpageToBottom();
  var step = 0;
  loadingStepInterval = setInterval(function() {
    step = (step + 1) % LOADING_STEPS.length;
    var label = document.getElementById(''fp-status-label'');
    if (label) label.textContent = LOADING_STEPS[step].text;
  }, 600);
}
function hideFullpageLoading() {
  state.isLoading = false;
  if (loadingStepInterval) { clearInterval(loadingStepInterval); loadingStepInterval = null; }
  var el = document.getElementById(''fullpage-loading-el'');
  if (el) el.remove();
}
/* ============================================================
   SCENARIO LOADER (demo toolbar)
   ============================================================ */
function loadScenario(scenarioKey) {
  if (!state.isAuthenticated) {
    alert(''Switch to Authenticated mode first.'');
    return;
  }
  // Open widget if not open
  if (!state.widgetOpen && !state.isFullPage) {
    state.widgetOpen = true;
    var panel = document.getElementById(''widget-panel'');
    panel.classList.remove(''hidden'');
    document.getElementById(''widget-fab'').setAttribute(''aria-expanded'', ''true'');
    document.getElementById(''widget-fab'').innerHTML = ''✕'';
  }
  var scenario = SCENARIOS[scenarioKey];
  if (!scenario) return;
  // Add user message
  state.messages.push({ type: ''user'', text: scenario.userMsg });
  if (scenarioKey === ''loading'') {
    // Show loading states for 3 seconds then show answer
    if (state.isFullPage) {
      renderFullpageMessages();
      scrollFullpageToBottom();
      showFullpageLoading();
      setTimeout(function() {
        hideFullpageLoading();
        state.messages.push(scenario.botResponse);
        renderFullpageMessages();
        scrollFullpageToBottom();
      }, 3000);
    } else {
      renderWidgetMessages();
      scrollWidgetToBottom();
      showWidgetLoading();
      setTimeout(function() {
        hideWidgetLoading();
        state.messages.push(scenario.botResponse);
        renderWidgetMessages();
        scrollWidgetToBottom();
      }, 3000);
    }
    return;
  }
  // Add bot response immediately for other scenarios
  state.messages.push(scenario.botResponse);
  if (state.isFullPage) {
    renderFullpageMessages();
    scrollFullpageToBottom();
  } else {
    renderWidgetMessages();
    scrollWidgetToBottom();
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   ESCALATION
   ============================================================ */
function submitEscalation(context) {
  var emailInput = document.getElementById(''esc-email-'' + context);
  var errorEl = document.getElementById(''esc-email-error-'' + context);
  var submitBtn = document.getElementById(''esc-submit-'' + context);
  var email = emailInput ? emailInput.value.trim() : '''';
  // Validate email (RFC 5322 simplified)
  var emailRegex = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/;
  if (!emailRegex.test(email)) {
    emailInput.classList.add(''error'');
    errorEl.classList.add(''visible'');
    emailInput.focus();
    return;
  }
  // Clear error
  emailInput.classList.remove(''error'');
  errorEl.classList.remove(''visible'');
  // Disable submit (idempotency)
  submitBtn.disabled = true;
  submitBtn.textContent = ''Sending…'';
  // Simulate dispatch
  setTimeout(function() {
    // Remove the escalation-prompt message and replace with success
    var idx = state.messages.findLastIndex(function(m) { return m.type === ''escalation-prompt''; });
    if (idx === -1) {
      // Fallback: find last index manually
      for (var i = state.messages.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        if (state.messages[i].type === ''escalation-prompt'') { idx = i; break; }
      }
    }
    if (idx !== -1) {
      state.messages[idx] = { type: ''escalation-success'', email: email };
    } else {
      state.messages.push({ type: ''escalation-success'', email: email });
    }
    if (context === ''fullpage'') {
      renderFullpageMessages();
      scrollFullpageToBottom();
    } else {
      renderWidgetMessages();
      scrollWidgetToBottom();
    }
  }, 800);
}
/* ============================================================
   CLEAR CONVERSATION
   ============================================================ */
function openClearDialog(target) {
  state.clearTarget = target;
  document.getElementById(''clear-dialog'').classList.add(''open'');
}
function closeClearDialog() {
  document.getElementById(''clear-dialog'').classList.remove(''open'');
  state.clearTarget = null;
}
function confirmClear() {
  state.messages = [];
  state.messageCount = 0;
  closeClearDialog();
  if (state.isFullPage) {
    renderFullpageMessages();
  } else {
    renderWidgetMessages();
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   RATE LIMIT
   ============================================================ */
function showRateLimitWarning() {
  var footer = document.getElementById(''widget-footer-text'');
  if (footer) {
    footer.innerHTML = ''<span style="color:var(--sl-warning);">⚠️ You\\''ve reached the 50 message limit for this session. Please clear your conversation or return tomorrow.</span>'';
  }
}
function updateRateLimitDisplay() {
  var footer = document.getElementById(''widget-footer-text'');
  if (footer) {
    footer.textContent = state.rateLimit + '' messages remaining this session'';
    if (state.rateLimit <= 10) {
      footer.style.color = ''var(--sl-warning)'';
    }
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   RETRY
   ============================================================ */
function retryLastMessage() {
  // Remove error message and last user message, re-send
  if (state.messages.length >= 2) {
    var last = state.messages[state.messages.length - 1];
    if (last.type === ''error'') {
      state.messages.pop(); // remove error
      var userMsg = state.messages[state.messages.length - 1];
      if (userMsg && userMsg.type === ''user'') {
        state.messages.pop(); // remove user msg
        var text = userMsg.text;
        // Re-inject
        state.messages.push({ type: ''user'', text: text });
        renderWidgetMessages();
        showWidgetLoading();
        setTimeout(function() {
          hideWidgetLoading();
          state.messages.push(SCENARIOS[''in-scope''].botResponse);
          renderWidgetMessages();
          scrollWidgetToBottom();
        }, 2000);
      }
    }
  }
}
/* ============================================================
   RESET
   ============================================================ */
function resetAll() {
  state.messages = [];
  state.messageCount = 0;
  state.rateLimit = 50;
  state.isLoading = false;
  if (loadingStepInterval) { clearInterval(loadingStepInterval); loadingStepInterval = null; }
  closeClearDialog();
  if (state.isFullPage) {
    minimiseToWidget();
  }
  if (state.widgetOpen) {
    toggleWidget();
  }
  setAuthState(true);
  navigateTo(''home'');
  renderWidgetMessages();
  updateRateLimitDisplay();
}
/* ============================================================
   SCROLL HELPERS
   ============================================================ */
function scrollWidgetToBottom() {
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById(''widget-messages'');
    if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
  }, 50);
}
function scrollFullpageToBottom() {
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById(''fullpage-messages'');
    if (el) el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
  }, 50);
}
/* ============================================================
   UTILITIES
   ============================================================ */
function escHtml(str) {
  if (!str) return '''';
  return String(str)
    .replace(/&/g, ''&amp;'')
    .replace(/</g, ''&lt;'')
    .replace(/>/g, ''&gt;'')
    .replace(/"/g, ''&quot;'')
    .replace(/''/g, ''&#39;'');
}
// Polyfill for findLastIndex (not in all browsers)
if (!Array.prototype.findLastIndex) {
  Array.prototype.findLastIndex = function(fn) {
    for (var i = this.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
      if (fn(this[i], i, this)) return i;
    }
    return -1;
  };
}
// Close modal on backdrop click
document.getElementById(''clear-dialog'').addEventListener(''click'', function(e) {
  if (e.target === this) closeClearDialog();
});
// Keyboard: Escape closes modal
document.addEventListener(''keydown'', function(e) {
  if (e.key === ''Escape'') {
    closeClearDialog();
    if (state.widgetOpen) toggleWidget();
  }
});
// Show welcome message on init
function showWelcomeMessage() {
  renderWidgetMessages();
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
